{"seq":3,"slug":"budget-efficiency-benchmark","title":"各市场预算效率对标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-marketing-budget-management/marketing-finance-review/budget-efficiency-benchmark","wordCount":2403,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"各市场预算效率对标\">各市场预算效率对标</h1><p>「东南亚的 ROAS 只有 1.8，欧洲有 3.5，是不是该把东南亚的预算砍掉一半？」这个推论看起来天经地义，实际上是<strong>用绝对指标做跨市场比较的经典错误</strong>。市场之间在规模、成熟度、渠道成本、竞争强度、数据质量上都不可比，直接比 ROAS 得到的结论会把资源从最有潜力的市场抽走。本文讲怎么做真正可用的横向对标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么绝对-roas-不可比\">核心概念：为什么绝对 ROAS 不可比</h2><p>同一个渠道、同一套打法，在两个市场会得到完全不同的 ROAS，原因几乎都与投放质量无关。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不可比因素</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场成熟度</td>\n<td>新兴市场渗透率低、用户教育成本高</td>\n<td>新兴市场 ROAS 低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞争强度</td>\n<td>高价市场 CPM 被推高</td>\n<td>高竞争市场 ROAS 低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道供给</td>\n<td>某些市场某渠道流量池小、很快饱和</td>\n<td>小市场快速衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客单价差异</td>\n<td>客单价低的市场 ROAS 天然低</td>\n<td>低客单市场 ROAS 低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因覆盖率</td>\n<td>身份打通率低的市场归因收入被低估</td>\n<td>数据弱的市场 ROAS 低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道组合</td>\n<td>有的市场只能用自有流量</td>\n<td>组合差异掩盖渠道效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前五项是真实的经济差异，第六项是<strong>数据质量差异</strong>——它最危险，因为它会让人把「我们没测清楚」误读成「这个市场不行」。第 1 篇提到的「可归因覆盖率」在跨市场比较里是一个必须被校正的维度。</p>\n<p><strong>关键结论：跨市场对标必须比「同一市场内的相对效率」，而不是比「绝对效率」。</strong> 也就是问「这个市场的投放做得比它的基准好还是差」，而不是「这个市场的 ROAS 高不高」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准的构造-三种可选口径\">基准的构造：三种可选口径</h2><p><strong>口径一：市场内时序基准。</strong> 用该市场自己的历史表现做基准——本季度边际 ROAS 相对该市场上四个季度的变化。这消除了市场间的结构性差异，但无法判断「这个市场整体上值不值得投」。</p>\n<p><strong>口径二：同层级市场基准。</strong> 把市场按规模、成熟度、客单价分层，在同层内比较。执行简单但分层本身主观，且层内仍可能有大量异质性。</p>\n<p><strong>口径三：饱和位置基准（最推荐）。</strong> 不比 ROAS，而比<strong>每个市场在其边际曲线上所处的相对位置</strong>。第一章第 2 篇的模型给出每个市场的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = \\frac{x_i}{K_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该市场当前投入相对其半饱和常数的倍数，<strong>它衡量的是「这个市场还有多少未被吃掉的增量空间」，且天然可跨市场比较</strong>——因为它已经把市场规模的因素吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对标口径</th>\n<th>消除了什么</th>\n<th>遗留问题</th>\n<th>适用决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对 ROAS</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>几乎全部结构差异</td>\n<td>仅同渠道同市场内部比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场内时序</td>\n<td>市场结构差异</td>\n<td>无法判断市场整体价值</td>\n<td>判断投放团队执行力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同层市场</td>\n<td>部分结构差异</td>\n<td>分层主观</td>\n<td>粗略排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>市场规模与容量</td>\n<td>依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{\\max}, K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计质量</td>\n<td><strong>预算再平衡的推荐口径</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做再平衡的规则很直观</strong>：如果市场 A 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_A = 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>（远未饱和）而市场 B 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_B = 2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span>（已经过饱和），那么把钱从 B 移到 A 应当提升整体回报，无论两者的绝对 ROAS 谁高。<strong>这就是「砍掉东南亚」那个直觉错误的修正版</strong>——东南亚的低 ROAS 可能只是因为它还在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 的早期阶段，而欧洲的 3.5 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 的成熟表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[各市场历史花费与增量数据] --&gt; B[拟合各市场 R_max 与 K]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算饱和位置 s_i = x_i/K_i]&#10;    C --&gt; D{s_i 分布}&#10;    D --&gt;|s &lt; 0.6 未饱和| E[潜在加投市场]&#10;    D --&gt;|0.6 &lt;= s &lt;= 1.5 接近饱和| F[维持或微调]&#10;    D --&gt;|s &gt; 1.5 过饱和| G[减投市场]&#10;    E --&gt; H[检查是否有其他约束&lt;br/&gt;合同/战略/合规]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[生成再平衡建议]&#10;    I --&gt; J[按预算版本流程走审批]\">graph TD\n    A[各市场历史花费与增量数据] --&gt; B[拟合各市场 R_max 与 K]\n    B --&gt; C[计算饱和位置 s_i = x_i/K_i]\n    C --&gt; D{s_i 分布}\n    D --&gt;|s &lt; 0.6 未饱和| E[潜在加投市场]\n    D --&gt;|0.6 &lt;= s &lt;= 1.5 接近饱和| F[维持或微调]\n    D --&gt;|s &gt; 1.5 过饱和| G[减投市场]\n    E --&gt; H[检查是否有其他约束&lt;br/&gt;合同/战略/合规]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[生成再平衡建议]\n    I --&gt; J[按预算版本流程走审批]</pre><h2 id=\"校正三类系统性偏差\">校正三类系统性偏差</h2><p>即使有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，还有三类偏差必须在计算前校正。</p>\n<p><strong>偏差一：数据成熟与归因覆盖。</strong> 数据弱的市场其增量估计的信噪比更低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计也更不可靠。校正方式是为每个市场计算一个<strong>估计置信度</strong>，并让置信度低的市场在再平衡中移动更小的幅度。<strong>不要让一个数据质量差的市场因为估不准而得到大额调整。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>偏差二：渠道组合差异。</strong> 一个市场可能没投某个高效渠道（因为该渠道在当地不可用），那么它的整体效率低不代表它的投放做得差。对标应当在<strong>同渠道内进行</strong>，或者至少把整体效率和渠道组合的影响分开呈现。</p>\n<p><strong>偏差三：生命周期阶段。</strong> 新进入的市场天然处于投入期，它的目标是建立认知与获取首批用户，此时应当用<strong>长期价值（LTV 视角）而非当期 ROAS</strong> 评估。把新市场与成熟市场放在同一把尺子上，等于要求新生儿和成年人比力气。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差</th>\n<th>校正手段</th>\n<th>若忽略的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归因覆盖差异</td>\n<td>按估计置信度缩放调整幅度</td>\n<td>数据弱的市场被错误削减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道组合差异</td>\n<td>同渠道内对标 + 组合影响分离</td>\n<td>缺渠道的市场被误判为低效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期阶段</td>\n<td>新市场用 LTV 口径单列</td>\n<td>新市场被砍，增长停滞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"再平衡的执行与防护\">再平衡的执行与防护</h2><p>对标得出「应该把钱从 B 移到 A」之后，执行本身有四个必须防护的点。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，不要一次移动太多。</strong> 大幅调整会触发两个问题：被削减的市场投放突然中断（学习期重置，见 <a href=\"../roi-incrementality/budget-overspend-guard\">超支预警/冻结/止损</a>），被加投的市场可能来不及吸收（渠道容量、团队执行能力、创意供给都是有限的）。<strong>单次再平衡幅度建议不超过该市场预算的 20%。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>其二，加投有吸收上限。</strong> 一个市场的投放团队可能只能有效管理当前规模的预算；加一倍预算不一定能带来预期的增量，因为执行能力本身是约束。<strong>再平衡建议必须包含对执行能力的评估，而不只是模型输出。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>其三，给跌出阈值的市场一个观察期。</strong> 一次对标结论不足以砍掉一个市场——可能是某个月的数据异常。建议的规则是：连续两个季度处于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &gt; 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> 才进入削减流程。</p>\n<p><strong>其四，显式记录战略例外。</strong> 有些市场不该按效率削减：进入期的战略市场、需要维持竞争防御的市场、有本地合规或合作承诺的市场。<strong>这些例外必须在系统里显式标注并说明理由</strong>，而不是在评审会上临时提出——临时例外会让整个对标体系失去可信度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MarketBenchmark {&#10;  marketId: string;&#10;  period: string;&#10;  estimates: { rMax: bigint; k: bigint; confidence: &#39;high&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;low&#39; };&#10;  saturationIndex: number;&#10;  channelMixDecay: number;&#10;  lifecycleStage: &#39;entering&#39; | &#39;growing&#39; | &#39;mature&#39; | &#39;declining&#39;;&#10;  strategicException?: { reason: string; owner: string; until: string };&#10;  recommendation: {&#10;    action: &#39;increase&#39; | &#39;hold&#39; | &#39;decrease&#39;;&#10;    pctChange: number;&#10;    rationale: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MarketBenchmark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  marketId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  estimates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rMax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  saturationIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channelMixDecay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lifecycleStage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'entering'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'growing'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mature'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'declining'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  strategicException</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">owner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'increase'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hold'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'decrease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    pctChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rationale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>strategicException</code> 带 <code>until</code> 日期是关键——<strong>例外必须有期限</strong>，否则「战略市场」会成为一个永久保留地的标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对标结果如何进入决策\">对标结果如何进入决策</h2><p>对标不是自动执行的规则，它的产出是<strong>建议</strong>，进入<a href=\"../budget-planning-allocation/budget-version-flow\">预算版本/审批/调整流</a>的预算版本流程走审批。但有一条可以自动化的部分：<strong>对标应当自动生成下一轮分配模型的市场间权重调整建议</strong>，作为分配优化的初始点。这样分配模型不必从零开始搜索，而是从一个已经考虑了对标信息的起点出发。</p>\n<p><strong>对标还必须与复盘（第 1 篇）形成交叉验证。</strong> 如果复盘说「市场 A 的投放策略正确但执行待改进」，而对标说「市场 A 已过饱和应该减投」，这两个结论并不矛盾——前者说单位投入做得好，后者说整体投入已过多。<strong>两者结合的正确动作是：维持预算但优化执行，或者小幅减投。</strong> 单看任何一个都可能做出片面决策。</p>\n<p><strong>最后，对标体系本身需要被校准。</strong> 如果按对标建议调整后，下个季度的整体回报没有改善，那么这个体系有问题——可能是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计不准，可能是遗漏了某个不可比因素。<strong>每一次再平衡都应当被记录为一次实验，并事后检验其效果。</strong> 这与第 1 篇「参数型复盘」的要求是一致的：对标体系本身也是一个应该被迭代的模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>绝对 ROAS 跨市场不可比，原因是市场成熟度、竞争强度、渠道供给、客单价、归因覆盖率、渠道组合六项结构差异。</li>\n<li>推荐的比较口径是<strong>饱和位置</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = x_i / K_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——它吸收了市场规模因素，回答「这个市场还有多少未被吃掉的增量空间」。</li>\n<li>三类必须校正的偏差：归因覆盖差异（按置信度缩放调整幅度）、渠道组合差异（同渠道内对标）、生命周期阶段（新市场用 LTV 口径单列）。</li>\n<li>再平衡执行四防护：单次幅度不超 20%、评估执行吸收能力、过饱和需连续两季度确认、战略例外显式标注且有期限。</li>\n<li>对标产出是建议而非自动执行，进入预算版本流程；必须与复盘交叉验证，且对标体系自身应作为可迭代模型被校准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各市场预算效率对标","id":"各市场预算效率对标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么绝对 ROAS 不可比","id":"核心概念-为什么绝对-roas-不可比"},{"level":2,"text":"基准的构造：三种可选口径","id":"基准的构造-三种可选口径"},{"level":2,"text":"校正三类系统性偏差","id":"校正三类系统性偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"再平衡的执行与防护","id":"再平衡的执行与防护"},{"level":2,"text":"对标结果如何进入决策","id":"对标结果如何进入决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"营销费用计提/对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-marketing-budget-management/marketing-finance-review/marketing-accrual"},"next":null}